# GuardTalkOS komodo telemetry kill (T-REMEDIATE-B2-TELEMETRY, items 11 + 14).
#
# Vendor init so persist.vendor.* writes are vendor_init (camera/slog/modem/rild
# property types). post-fs-data so /data persist is mounted. Re-asserts after
# an upgrade from a userdebug image that already stored the Google defaults.
# Does not start RIL. Does not edit init.guardtalk.hardening.rc.

on post-fs-data
    setprop persist.vendor.camera.exif_reveal_make_model false
    setprop persist.vendor.sys.silentlog.tcp Off
    setprop persist.vendor.sys.modem.logging.enable false
    setprop persist.vendor.ril.log_mask 0
    setprop persist.logd.logpersistd ""
    setprop logd.logpersistd.enable false
    setprop logd.logpersistd ""
